--- title
# Domine a Guitarra

--- body
Free guitar-learning platform combining structured lessons, music-theory tools and browser-based practice.

--- actions
[Website](https://domineaguitarra.com.br/) · [Portfolio](/en/#products)
:::

::: section architecture
## Architecture

The platform serves statically generated lesson pages alongside client-side musical tools.

- **Curriculum:** modular lessons and study paths, authored as Markdown content.
- **Music domain:** TypeScript models for notes, intervals, chords, voicings, rhythm patterns and progressions.
- **Interactive components:** chord and fretboard diagrams, synchronized tablature playback and rhythm exercises.
- **Audio:** browser-based synthesis through the Web Audio API for playable examples and ear-training exercises.
- **Student workspace:** browser-local storage for study preferences, annotations and progress.
- **Publishing:** static-site builds deployed through GitHub and Cloudflare.

Music exercises, diagrams and audio playback share structured musical data rather than separately authored representations.
:::

::: section technologies
## Technologies

- **Web framework:** Astro with static output.
- **Language and content:** TypeScript and Markdown.
- **Audio:** Web Audio API.
- **Interface:** reusable Astro components with browser-side interaction.
- **Deployment:** GitHub and Cloudflare.
:::

